No other release, no ball in any frame. Preserve two natural arms, hands, legs and shoes in all complete poses.

Match the supplied tiny 2D gameplay reference: crisp limited-palette 1990s arcade pixel art with chunky dark outlines, not painterly, photorealistic, 3D, glossy or anime. Keep all hair tips, hands and shoes within each cell. True RGBA alpha-zero background, transparent gutters, no alpha haze, matte or checkerboard. Return only the sprite sheet.
